      "id": "body",
      "bbox": [
        158,
        508,
        919,
        669
      ],
      "text": "The team has been working hard behind the scenes laying a strong foundation for the Thunderbird iOS app. Rather than leveraging existing code, we are building natively from scratch. This fresh start allows us to take everything we've learned from Thunderbird Desktop and Android to ensure a fast, reliable, and modern experience on your iPhone [...]",
      "zh": "該團隊在幕後努力,為 Thunderbird iOS 應用程式奠定了堅實的基礎。我們並非利用現有的程式碼,而是從零開始進行原生建置。這個嶄新的開始讓我們能將從 Thunderbird 桌面與 Android 技術中學到的一切,確保 iPhone 上能快速、可靠且現代地體驗。",
      "role": "paragraph"
